    "expression_latex": "8 \\eta [G_{\\bar{\\EL}}+ \\frac{1}{\\eta}\\max(G_{R_X}, G_{R_Y})]^2 ( 1 + \\ln(T) )+ \\frac{T}{\\eta} \\max_{y} R_Y(y) + \\frac{T}{\\eta} \\max_{x} R_X(x)",
